; The JSON rendering of every answer, shared by the command line and the MCP
; server so both emit the same object for the same question. No I/O: it builds
; a [Json.t] and the caller prints it.
;
; Not part of [writ_runtime], which depends on [writ_data] only, nor of
; [writ_cli], which the MCP server must not link. Unwrapped, like its
; neighbours.

(library
 (name writ_report_json)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries writ_data writ_runtime writ_json))
